  LightRotation: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 1}
  Description: 'Beta Pindola is the name of the harsh uninhabitable planet at the heart of the Pindolan sector. It is also the headquaters of the Lambda Corporation and the busiest trading hub in known space. A variety of military installations are in orbit of the planet including the TEF flight school. Despite a heavy military presence, the sector is often the source of sporadic violence. This is not helped by the Lamda forces turning a blind eye to any infractions. '
